  "store": {
    "title": "Tijd: Iwashi Lamagama",
    "short_description": "Isikhathi ngamagama esikrinini sasekhaya. Khetha ulimi nesitayela sakho.",
    "full_description": "Iwashi ngolimi nangesitayela osithandayo.\n\nI-Tijd iyiwijethi ebonisa isikhathi ngamagama esikrinini sasekhaya se-Android. Kunezinketho ezingu-91 zolimi, indlela yokubhala nezindlela zesifunda. Ungahlela isitayela sewijethi ngayinye ngokwehlukana.\n\n• Ukuhleleka okuncane noma umugqa owodwa.\n• Amafonti, imibala engu-40 nokubonakala kokungemuva kwephaneli okulungisekayo.\n• Ukubuka kuqala ngokushesha nezitayela ezilondoloziwe.\n• Thinta ukuze uvule uhlelo lwewashi.\n\nAyidingi i-inthanethi. Azikho izikhangiso, ama-akhawunti noma ukuqoqwa kwedatha.\n\nEngeza iwijethi ku-Tijd noma ekukhetheni amawijethi esikrinini sasekhaya. Vumela Ama-alamu nezikhumbuzi ukuze ibuyekezwe njalo ngomzuzu. Ukubuyekeza kungase kume okwesikhashana lapho ifoni ilele. Ezinye izilungiselelo zokubukeka zidinga i-Android 12 noma entsha."
